<fragment mode="section" requested-start="doxcnmeP5x9aGqaqyWv9oWzWFcg"><h2 id="doxcnmeP5x9aGqaqyWv9oWzWFcg" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.11">管理端操作</h2><p id="doxcnPtKxbgiVqp3qbwmKRpNlmc">对应 PRD 3.2.1—3.2.6。以下是商家 Web 管理端的业务交互，不是要求管理员操作 CloudBase 开发控制台；开通账户、部署和商户凭证配置属于上线准备。</p><h3 id="doxcnI9kYmHtBDsYoBqFApDoGre" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.11.1">管理员登录</h3><whiteboard id="doxcnzwF0vsE0EW3XwNXs39I0Te" token="XNqewnNhZh0vnhb56Rtc2AcnnVb" type="mermaid">sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as 商家 Web 管理端
    participant C as CloudBase 身份认证
    participant B as 业务普通云函数
    participant D as CloudBase MySQL
    A-&gt;&gt;C: 用户名、密码登录
    C--&gt;&gt;A: 已验证会话与账户 UID
    A-&gt;&gt;B: SDK 携带会话发起管理请求
    B-&gt;&gt;B: 从认证上下文读取 UID
    B-&gt;&gt;D: admin_allowlist 按 auth_uid 校验 enabled 和 is_deleted
    alt 允许访问
      B--&gt;&gt;A: 业务结果
    else 无有效会话或不在白名单
      B--&gt;&gt;A: 拒绝访问，不执行管理写入
    end
    A-&gt;&gt;C: 退出，注销会话</whiteboard><h4 id="doxcn5L721zwLzkNqQzFX0LJphe" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.11.1.1">登录与业务鉴权边界</h4><table id="doxcnwxyROdurQzkS6R81iiLiAf"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnRgto1ae6nAOc91I5Uissqg">步骤</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnblOYXteirU2hEbvrDWoX1e">执行组件</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn77I1a3hlRchqbp0xbG2Aqe">结果</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnOyXd9I1P023lE8hite1CMJ">账号密码登录</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnXUn4u0hIJPqog0ozKNrkVd">商家 Web 管理端 → CloudBase 身份认证</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnA8ijPtKv2Xcc6XJeb889ci">平台校验密码并建立会话，返回认证用户 UID。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnahkHuuK4X5fw5uhwPBVTFf">调用管理 action</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnfwvznDV0OL5rTHYp2vn94e">商家 Web 管理端 → business-api</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnpdYmjRihE6wlFaPzIOE68g">Web SDK 携带会话；对应管理 Handler 从认证上下文读取可信 UID并完成请求结构校验。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnMKVk8z930fkm2PUvwiQ2Dh">业务授权</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn9c2z92Cw1ibYw4pWMGz0Pe">领域 Service → AdminAccessService → admin_allowlist</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnFyaUk9M9nUW7DHvYo00Uwb">只有 enabled=1、is_deleted=0 的 UID 可以继续执行业务。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxcnFWOuMSYAHc9ti2UzvHvxub"><b>前端登录示意</b></p><pre id="doxcnorxsg9JaOUjvdTE29nKXkf" caption="&#xA;" lang="typescript" wrap="false"><code>const auth = app.auth;<br/>const { data, error } = await auth.signInWithPassword({<br/>  username,<br/>  password<br/>});<br/><br/>if (error) throw error;<br/>// 登录成功后再调用 business-api 管理 action；<br/>// 前端不把 data.user.id 或其他 UID 当作业务入参提交给后端。</code></pre><p id="doxcnmOJ1DFReeDxu7syAs5iQWb" text-indent="1">具体 Web SDK 方法名以上线时使用的 SDK 版本为准；密码只提交给 CloudBase 身份认证，business-api 仅接收平台验证后的会话身份。</p><p id="doxcnuHJM5CLzr3UPDwyYCEHZph" text-indent="1">开发前必须在 CloudBase 身份认证中启用 usernamePassword 登录方式，并给管理端配置真实 Publishable Key；管理员账号通过平台用户管理能力创建，不在浏览器端开放注册。</p><p id="doxcnEsGPRLoe26ANU0TIVkwjye"><b>管理 action 的统一鉴权</b></p><ol><li id="doxcndn7bnKLIsp9uUaL9LcYjGf" seq="1" seq-marker="1. ">确认请求包含平台验证的登录会话；没有会话返回 UNAUTHORIZED。</li><li id="doxcn5qgPUYj3xgI4RsvwwrQEfc" seq-marker="2. ">从服务端认证上下文取得 UID，不接受 payload.auth_uid。</li><li id="doxcnrjGWMMEAmlgHQrlc4iv2Kf" seq-marker="3. ">Handler 调用对应领域 Service；Service 使用 AdminAccessService 查询 admin_allowlist.auth_uid=当前 UID、enabled=1、is_deleted=0。</li><li id="doxcn3oCtOAHQU39UWsFpuoGh6g" seq-marker="4. ">白名单未命中时 Service 返回 FORBIDDEN，不执行数据库业务写入。</li><li id="doxcnvxfArsyQm9wsZ2OyXerLfb" seq-marker="5. ">AdminAccessService 返回 operator_uid，领域 Service 将其写入库存流水、配置修改和订单操作审计字段。</li></ol><p id="doxcnSE4pp8DeL9MjkQVeRFIqHe"><b>相关数据</b></p><table id="doxcnpMV6m3ph1qvU8nY4bUdYLg"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcniEYJTTfIjh3ukJDrssgzUd">位置</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnBtpnPOQMAAzSC7AOh7fGkf">保存内容</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnazJ1bAV9Fp0HEUZDvTr0gh">职责边界</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn83EXDx2ns8uxF4QlPwjA7g">CloudBase 身份认证</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnD7re1LXdiQJPhCGsoENXzI">账号、密码凭据、会话和 UID。</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnE51vlGzMhONKXUKnQUfWag">商城业务权限。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcngXfmxc3QglW8jtsTJusXjh">admin_allowlist</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnYKrAQzfbNIoyiGYXZbq4kf">允许管理商城的 UID、展示名和 enabled。</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn41GphPFfjitA2hhm5ydJqd">密码、会话 token。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxcnZsHQN2g3v1CXIxDuiVyuHf"><b>错误码：</b>无有效会话返回 UNAUTHORIZED；UID 不在有效白名单返回 FORBIDDEN。</p><p id="doxcnKc0psyKbLPF4rJeeYB4gAf">依据：<a href="https://docs.cloudbase.net/authentication-v2/auth/manage-users">创建与管理认证用户</a>；<a href="https://docs.cloudbase.net/api-reference/webv3/authentication#signinwithpassword">Web 密码登录</a>；<a href="https://docs.cloudbase.net/api-reference/server/node-sdk/auth">服务端认证上下文</a>。</p><h3 id="doxcnzUXK4iR6F82aNMoWXlPCLd" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.11.2">分类、商品、素材与页面配置</h3><whiteboard id="doxcn4yW3H1VropPp1ShuhovNJe" token="RR6Qw0f6zhijl2bBLjjc1Dlnneg" type="mermaid">sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as 商家 Web 管理端
    participant B as 业务普通云函数
    participant D as CloudBase MySQL
    participant S as CloudBase 云存储
    A-&gt;&gt;B: 申请上传素材或维护目录
    B-&gt;&gt;B: 校验可信管理员与可写范围
    B--&gt;&gt;A: 按平台权限允许上传
    A-&gt;&gt;S: SDK 在授权范围上传图片
    S--&gt;&gt;A: 文件标识
    A-&gt;&gt;B: 提交商品、SKU 或固定结构配置
    B-&gt;&gt;B: 校验字段及文件引用权限
    B-&gt;&gt;D: 写 catalog_items、catalog_skus 或 site_config
    D--&gt;&gt;B: 保存成功
    B--&gt;&gt;A: 返回结果
    Note over B,D: 下架改 is_on_sale；删除改 is_deleted；历史素材保留</whiteboard><h4 id="doxcnXxJFnTEQ3ITSGtUExqasrm" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.11.2.1">接口清单</h4><table id="doxcnZ6oUASpqz9NJvRvnoZKQhg"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnlUBtRHYRi9wAUDsIyaRYzc">云函数与action</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnc8VsT52O6KjYkqDsl2ms1c">身份</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnHKmD0u0AXGre3vqR902rOI">用途</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnj37ps0jFN3r4wELnAhpBfb">listAdminCategories</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnUwEnPmjHfhjWVdCNQZfg2I">认证UID + 白名单</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnPKCAwmeUm8jVItNL0Ni6Lb">分页查询分类和启用状态。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnZNFuWsL6PHdU4I5rzbjwFb">listAdminItems</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnRya7nkl17EDMLyaUNBiHwy">认证UID + 白名单</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnSw6la7KAhhnpArXvOtBcub">按分类、名称和上下架状态查询商品及库存摘要。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnkrFLCX5sX4LsVibK6NxPjd">getAdminCatalogItem</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn4g33nFdLvqmkazVmIVUFUh">认证UID + 白名单</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnJh6we55QOeJH9piJnYHUDg">返回商品和全部未删除SKU，供完整编辑表单使用。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcng6uKi0AT5ZXqlsg9YEiXlg">saveCategory</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnfgnwVApQ3lvszbi8vUintc">认证UID + 白名单</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn19MwQ1WheXksFMDo7KYImg">新增或修改分类、排序和启用状态；停用前检查子SKU预占。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcniNTj3DXApv5sphlPam4UYf">saveCatalogItem</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnQAApFV3sfZIgJhcozVhsCc">认证UID + 白名单</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnlC3iqGGV9jfRU9SVDevNPD">新增或修改商品公共资料、spec_schema和上下架状态；下架前检查子SKU预占。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnQjwAgd35V2XrSEIooa8slp">saveCatalogSku</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnHALHKj2SBRSZCxGyG9J49N">认证UID + 白名单</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnDC1uu7PMOxSxnOuBc51Xjh">全量保存SKU；校验重复规格；从上架改为下架时校验影响摘要并退回AVAILABLE券积分。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnbJGxoHjzODygy8gmLE8lXf">previewSkuDeactivation</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn8uYpt9CaV3nZe7mHa0GYQd">认证UID + 白名单</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnNTVcfHff96OpLsl4GF2Bqc">预览SKU库存预占、待付款订单和按账户聚合的兑换券退分影响。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcng3Mmr6EiOaEadtKVEdmf5e">deleteCategory</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnns7OmgHZmWwdsh3YRASKSc">认证UID + 白名单</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn7JFvuWIvFbkUfnKV04FM2c">分类没有未删除商品后逻辑删除。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnhhTYJt9AWzlX4Qq9baBucc">deleteCatalogItem</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnqiTH8XI4bMnvWxKORlLZPY">认证UID + 白名单</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnjU7kXl9quI3pffUub4Wdog">商品没有未删除SKU后逻辑删除。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnKVkxdIPWhgP5Ln85wVPnKc">deleteCatalogSku</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn4xsTx4SBf7tiHsv0IGAg9c">认证UID + 白名单</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnpzrIJICp5VWWt6Sac1frtq">校验无库存预占和最新影响摘要后退分并逻辑删除SKU。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnGiQIezGvW9tKsTMWDnt8xe">getSiteConfig / updateSiteConfig</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnJqPpC9lrDb5JgqYi4cuGXe">认证UID + 白名单</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcniNG1eZi447R8QFXrF5MUlR">读取或修改固定结构站点配置。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnjb1amE72m2afW3m7BX9B8b">CloudBase云存储SDK</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnnRHQ729Xr5QWrG5zuPYcpg">已登录管理端 + 存储规则</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnkLIUCrAAbI26B73hoIEGCd">上传商品、SKU、Banner和二维码图片，返回文件标识。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxcnSLfJKCPtIgMSlhpNJC8KNf"><b>代码映射</b></p><table id="doxcnYhU6vojfNaAfaN9Na15Jwe"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnDaGdWH00JYQ4cA9wHZFQvc">action</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnSvJnSewkLHuCZ8xdnzUO3v">Handler</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn3w3XQ8SId7gwTaWTgXPXDb">Service方法</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnrSYC1i6ApA1gAr0HjAgSFf">事务</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn93vuwu4NPMgjEyEnqeKcke">DAO</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcng60iOszKHO0JxAyLxZetqb">listAdminCategories</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn7IfgErAy0C0VQs2sm7cP6e">ListAdminCategoriesHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn3t73WP1D3BV1tV0VpzCiPe">AdminCatalogService.listCategories()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn6tVoJuHkVIBT5rHYniEiAc">否</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnKLP7ummBipNg8v2tvb2SWf">AdminDAO、CategoryDAO</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnx6QPNbIkVhNFgovgqFk0Xf">listAdminItems</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcngfqHxzv7otqy7OA67muoRv">ListAdminItemsHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn5EYQukgULB3jBrf8cIt9Y3">AdminCatalogService.listItems()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcndiMYtkDRTJr9g9Kl1Y5F5f">否</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn1f0td4CcC5DDcpGX5RL2Vc">AdminDAO、CatalogItemDAO、SkuDAO</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnCvVoJuIhxq1zGVdbgmV4xb">getAdminCatalogItem</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnPMz3kgtArmYna232uYBqwe">GetAdminCatalogItemHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnROpbqyp4RFmPoBOVV0kvBc">AdminCatalogService.getItem()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcne0YKw0aCDqO23P12xws73c">否</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcngqmkBNx3N7BMr4yvL1T1rh">AdminDAO、CatalogItemDAO、SkuDAO</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnzplGrXSfxK1kwh6Gj9lEbg">saveCategory</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnI2AHM69USrDiXTInxW3gCb">SaveCategoryHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnS7gVqkXH4o0MtLgPfjYNWc">AdminCatalogService.saveCategory()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnhug46jgnS5DYTVnBIbynFh">条件性</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn1iwBxvotHLUzunS3vuVEzf">AdminDAO、CategoryDAO、CatalogItemDAO、SkuDAO</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnsI3EgLUcXon4OGNh3gIRAd">saveCatalogItem</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcni9UAfoSBnZirXrYiPj8rOg">SaveCatalogItemHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcntwssNYZoboFIKvmIygBCXe">AdminCatalogService.saveItem()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnOoRB4DKshYPw2VgvWwYcme">条件性</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcntfYuV4uiQpMjosQP1twkAd">AdminDAO、CategoryDAO、CatalogItemDAO、SkuDAO</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnSU79V8VRS8sybRIpWXzo1g">saveCatalogSku</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnXsDjJUxAp4QtCAPf6X2n0g">SaveCatalogSkuHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnm0T5r3o0GO971eo5p6exoo">AdminCatalogService.saveSku()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnAuvqyL0Eke4PMQpJ8nlWqd">条件性</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn00ugV6d93ipwrpWbrMceJe">AdminDAO、CatalogItemDAO、SkuDAO、ReservationDAO、SkuCouponDAO、PointsAccountDAO、PointsLedgerDAO</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnwyYnTs11DAyqKLSBMGJQud">previewSkuDeactivation</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnMchodm5ArLQQavjftNCqqg">PreviewSkuDeactivationHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn6dGZ1KHzBLDvfsJcIl6Wnd">AdminCatalogService.previewSkuDeactivation()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnkiuWbdPbHBsz75o6tkJOfe">否</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnN011tKdCNoys8L79FBVKdb">AdminDAO、SkuDAO、ReservationDAO、SkuCouponDAO、PointsAccountDAO</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn2PxLzKmREQJB6fbnfGkqDd">deleteCategory</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnwe4OO4Q0w0cZ1saQGQ1Psh">DeleteCategoryHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnbyslzqZHL9JYUxXxj6dV6g">AdminCatalogService.deleteCategory()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnkX3uJ1fhmjSncooPIEtTJc">条件性</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnsy3vbkwIvBODUpoCNZZIof">AdminDAO、CategoryDAO、CatalogItemDAO、SkuDAO</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnEQmYx32gn4iLG76uSrNxhh">deleteCatalogItem</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcntMp3adFl3zsZKqK7WXiYmc">DeleteCatalogItemHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn2OlNEUjXRzUbOLuiDsC6yb">AdminCatalogService.deleteItem()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnvHRfBb7eh6a0jtSSSOj41e">条件性</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnVjBJETnGBWw0I7wL5Qcl8f">AdminDAO、CatalogItemDAO、SkuDAO</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnILMWFcWIqleAjtWDysSNPf">deleteCatalogSku</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn0zsvDRxHxQyd2pLmhgR2Hc">DeleteCatalogSkuHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnQXipnKMVb1s8Omj4R2uOic">AdminCatalogService.deleteSku()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnGC4AIkXKyxuydjBWHMftYd">是</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnD1DacKxGwAcE3mgPAH0UYe">AdminDAO、SkuDAO、ReservationDAO、SkuCouponDAO、PointsAccountDAO、PointsLedgerDAO</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcni4JC8JAm4OBI0tBQ6f252f">getSiteConfig</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnidc4XnKO8V85BF0leepImc">GetSiteConfigHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnTalkiMYKs83jEbSkgxY51e">SiteConfigService.getSiteConfig()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnV0KFixQFgeorPBqGPqWEsC">否</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnK0MxVRbcIJI0LqzobxvFOb">AdminDAO、SiteConfigDAO</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnMFxfVJqdHit6ypRlT5zOGd">updateSiteConfig</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn5476NaTur8he4CiQt2HWn4">UpdateSiteConfigHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnWTL3NGclW5ZWSq3OYaHqEf">SiteConfigService.updateSiteConfig()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnwVAgJteUPPZsh97gWGnj0s">否</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnCbeXbWDlwXX9oHLJQxuM4d">AdminDAO、SiteConfigDAO</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h4 id="doxcn23Di51tTS9EjpxVkAhnEWf" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.11.2.2">管理查询、响应与逻辑删除</h4><p id="doxcnZ77p7Pzlhb5th0KcpGlrGe" text-indent="1">管理接口复用4.7的统一响应和分页结构。本节只固定管理页面真正依赖的数据；列表返回摘要，详情返回可直接回填编辑表单的完整模型，保存返回最新完整结果，删除返回删除后的标识和状态。</p><p id="doxcnwmsh8HNWp2oZFPa6bxWZwf"><b>分类列表</b></p><pre id="doxcn9g0fd3T99KVqN1P1PcF3hc" caption="请求&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "listAdminCategories",<br/>  "payload": {<br/>    "catalog_type": null,<br/>    "page_token": null,<br/>    "page_size": 20<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><pre id="doxcnpKDSzgleaO6FmctrrQxjRg" caption="响应&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "ok": true,<br/>  "code": "OK",<br/>  "message": "",<br/>  "data": {<br/>    "items": [<br/>      {<br/>        "category_id": "100",<br/>        "catalog_type": "BEAD",<br/>        "name": "水晶",<br/>        "sort_order": 10,<br/>        "is_enabled": true,<br/>        "item_count": 12,<br/>        "updated_at": "2026-10-09T14:00:00+08:00"<br/>      }<br/>    ],<br/>    "next_page_token": null<br/>  },<br/>  "request_id": "cloudbase-request-id"<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcn5rswmZUMD2o95CcmSjflFe"><b>商品列表</b></p><pre id="doxcnpM1yvMepv3OA2JDeYSXsif" caption="请求&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "listAdminItems",<br/>  "payload": {<br/>    "category_id": "100",<br/>    "name_keyword": "白水晶",<br/>    "is_on_sale": null,<br/>    "page_token": null,<br/>    "page_size": 20<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><pre id="doxcntECLIPgvedlr0eUGW4SIKe" caption="响应&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "ok": true,<br/>  "code": "OK",<br/>  "message": "",<br/>  "data": {<br/>    "items": [<br/>      {<br/>        "item_id": "3001",<br/>        "category_id": "100",<br/>        "catalog_type": "STANDARD",<br/>        "name": "白水晶成品手串",<br/>        "is_on_sale": true,<br/>        "sku_count": 2,<br/>        "stock_total": 20,<br/>        "stock_reserved": 3,<br/>        "updated_at": "2026-10-09T14:00:00+08:00"<br/>      }<br/>    ],<br/>    "next_page_token": null<br/>  },<br/>  "request_id": "cloudbase-request-id"<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcnEklKufgL0QlhBzn20rUN2e"><b>商品编辑详情</b></p><pre id="doxcnnP5956YDBTj7RBTorKsmNb" caption="请求&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "getAdminCatalogItem",<br/>  "payload": {"item_id": "3001"}<br/>}</code></pre><pre id="doxcnEnHckpgGOScgplt7kDI4Sg" caption="响应&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "ok": true,<br/>  "code": "OK",<br/>  "message": "",<br/>  "data": {<br/>    "item_id": "3001",<br/>    "category_id": "100",<br/>    "catalog_type": "STANDARD",<br/>    "name": "白水晶成品手串",<br/>    "description": "商品说明",<br/>    "images": ["cloud://product/3001.png"],<br/>    "spec_schema": {"dimensions": []},<br/>    "is_on_sale": true,<br/>    "skus": [<br/>      {<br/>        "sku_id": "4001",<br/>        "spec_values": {"gravel_type": "STANDARD_WHITE"},<br/>        "diameter_mm": null,<br/>        "image_file_id": "cloud://sku/4001.png",<br/>        "price_cent": 12800,<br/>        "stock_total": 15,<br/>        "stock_reserved": 3,<br/>        "available_stock": 12,<br/>        "is_on_sale": true,<br/>        "points_exchange_enabled": false,<br/>        "points_cost": null,<br/>        "updated_at": "2026-10-09T14:00:00+08:00"<br/>      }<br/>    ],<br/>    "updated_at": "2026-10-09T14:00:00+08:00"<br/>  },<br/>  "request_id": "cloudbase-request-id"<br/>}</code></pre><table id="doxcnmxrGSvc2pFRztLzGjNWqqc"><colgroup><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnyJeeGVw38uOU7sS5DJ3pfg">接口类型</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnlyLwMzHZs3shuytyfObf9d">响应约定</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnOk99lcLf21ObwwgbZ0HgMf">列表</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn5hZcc5DmGp1Hih9cFmGPsd">返回items和next_page_token；列表只返回页面筛选、展示和跳转需要的摘要字段。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn1ywDc26zTa4GgInoHi1f4d">详情</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnrSQoiYo953FR9QLKzSiFqd">返回编辑表单所需完整字段；getAdminCatalogItem同时返回全部未删除SKU。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnNBRsBrWVaCXZH1KPUrBirc">保存</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn8x5LI6XMsPWujhxPHr065c">返回保存后的完整实体和updated_at，前端用响应替换本地表单数据。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnRimwsrUAbAy1FjCi8dpqlc">删除</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnGX2ioCRxm07pIzRu0cePZ4">返回目标id、is_deleted=true、updated_at以及实际退回的兑换券数量和积分；SKU删除响应见5.11.2.6。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcntMkQ3oEMjkIg9kcoa1m4Sh">审计列表</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnlkR8H1VSH1PXe0UeURamXg">积分、邀请、兑换券和支付对账列表使用相同分页约定，items字段按各自章节定义。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxcnMUHkFiSWrZGm2kHaw3xpEg"><b>查询规则：</b>管理列表默认查询is_deleted=0，同时返回is_enabled、is_on_sale、stock_total和stock_reserved；用户端查询继续按可购买条件过滤。名称关键词使用参数化查询。</p><p id="doxcngk79SmIvOdyw0I0HFH1UGd"><b>删除规则：</b>所有删除均为逻辑删除。分类存在未删除商品时不能删除；商品存在未删除SKU时不能直接删除。管理端必须先按5.11.2.6逐个处理子SKU的预占、兑换券退分、下架或删除，再删除商品和分类。历史design_versions.components、order_items.item_snapshot和已经引用的云存储文件不随目录删除而清除。</p><p id="doxcncCo5zmLSdRAK6BWABMG7vg"><b>配置读取：</b>getSiteConfig只接受代码白名单中的config_key，返回管理端可编辑的完整config_value；与用户端getPublicSiteConfig的公开字段过滤不同。</p><h4 id="doxcn5LoGuszrU5MEoagbnB3Pkh" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.11.2.3">saveCategory</h4><pre id="doxcnNWyt0DZlwwVXEKIG8h7Ojh" caption="&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "saveCategory",<br/>  "payload": {<br/>    "category_id": null,<br/>    "catalog_type": "STANDARD",<br/>    "name": "成品手串",<br/>    "sort_order": 10,<br/>    "is_enabled": true<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcnCOPGrszOFOzeoBRIw6mx6e"><b>后端逻辑：</b>新增时插入 catalog_categories；修改时查询 is_deleted=0 的目标分类。分类已有 catalog_items 后禁止修改 catalog_type；停用只更新 is_enabled=0，不删除商品。</p><h4 id="doxcnNJZJQ5wj3DPfFxiEfqsjpb" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.11.2.4">saveCatalogItem</h4><pre id="doxcn0VWi2Wp55D0XeZQhk0WErh" caption="&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "saveCatalogItem",<br/>  "payload": {<br/>    "item_id": "3001",<br/>    "category_id": "100",<br/>    "name": "白水晶成品手串",<br/>    "description": "商品说明",<br/>    "images": ["cloud://product/3001.png"],<br/>    "spec_schema": {<br/>      "dimensions": [<br/>        {<br/>          "key": "gravel_type",<br/>          "label": "碎石",<br/>          "options": [<br/>            {"value": "STANDARD_WHITE", "label": "标准白水晶"}<br/>          ]<br/>        }<br/>      ]<br/>    },<br/>    "is_on_sale": true<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcneHEH9aVZxQJrqBNHp1QVif"><b>后端逻辑：</b>校验 category_id 存在、未删除；已有商品只能移动到相同 catalog_type 的分类。STANDARD 商品校验 spec_schema 的 key、label、options 结构；BEAD/ACCESSORY 可以为空。图片字段只接收已上传的云存储文件标识。</p><h4 id="doxcnXfpmwH3TkAVRSBtVjb8NTe" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.11.2.5">saveCatalogSku</h4><p id="doxcn78pxLSNb6tmEf5OiVORRdg" text-indent="1">saveCatalogSku 是新增或修改SKU的全量保存接口，不是PATCH。管理端编辑页先调用getAdminCatalogItem取得完整资料，再提交全部可编辑字段；缺少必填字段不会解释为保留旧值。</p><pre id="doxcndkJBEdhn1Y2woqbLL5hTsg" caption="全量保存请求&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "saveCatalogSku",<br/>  "payload": {<br/>    "sku_id": "4001",<br/>    "item_id": "3001",<br/>    "spec_values": {"gravel_type": "STANDARD_WHITE"},<br/>    "diameter_mm": null,<br/>    "image_file_id": "cloud://sku/4001.png",<br/>    "price_cent": 12800,<br/>    "is_on_sale": true,<br/>    "points_exchange_enabled": true,<br/>    "points_cost": 100,<br/>    "deactivation_impact_hash": null<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><table id="doxcnZIkef6303VulNpkYq7tYpe"><colgroup><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnwOJycG7m7nvv2zMhE2LTqf">字段</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnnrZ6pMYGyLNv72v9unSBBC">规则</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcndrq9xa2z6zykm8EyliHjLf">sku_id</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnq3N5xdELHfA4nTjsJl8OKg">新增时为空；修改时必须存在且未删除。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnVPOZ2dynynOqG4bDY2GpHb">item_id</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcne5S7zfNzrXcfHWEgPmkyyc">必填；商品必须存在且未删除。已有SKU不允许改到另一商品。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn3nIHvXPgav8SM179Jqn0tg">spec_values</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn8lJt4u7Shq4BMiQJ3lKpkc">STANDARD商品按catalog_items.spec_schema校验；BEAD和ACCESSORY可为空。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnevSHjTAd8wY8YY6MjjdsTd">diameter_mm</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnyi1ZygaEyUgSOfBq7UeWCc">珠子或配件按实际规格填写；标准商品可为空。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnvpHv3u6yTER8UD6hGVClVb">price_cent、image_file_id、is_on_sale</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnO0Y8T94AicBJfzKE3wsN6b">完整提交当前值；图片必须是已上传的CloudBase云存储文件标识。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcniNczl0IhpptGnwjXDJZL6b">points_exchange_enabled、points_cost</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnpoPFTxTRTa4QwG0IxcOBIe">只允许BEAD开启；开启时points_cost必须大于0，关闭时points_cost写NULL。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn33FmLUBbdfnFVDrCM1EEdg">deactivation_impact_hash</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnHzNZ0kucNJoWxlH7KT18Sc">普通保存为空；现有SKU从上架改为下架时，必须提交previewSkuDeactivation最新返回的impact_hash。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxcn32xHhykcITY3YEGo3PwE1i"><b>规格唯一性</b></p><ol><li id="doxcnLf9hvLH6GUxYnuK0RdJNYH" seq="1" seq-marker="1. ">SaveCatalogSkuHandler只校验完整payload结构并调用AdminCatalogService.saveSku()。</li><li id="doxcn1fDyffAoUAEDGKXOh3hwfg" seq-marker="2. ">Service校验管理员权限，事务内锁定所属catalog_items。</li><li id="doxcncn6RBs6EAVw6wTIPojfyKP" seq-marker="3. ">STANDARD商品按spec_schema.dimensions顺序重建spec_values，只保留定义中的key和value，序列化为无多余空白的规范JSON并计算SHA-256 spec_signature。</li><li id="doxcniQoRB97dFPTuetZ9ihzvTb" seq-marker="4. ">按item_id、spec_signature、is_deleted=0查询其他SKU；排除当前sku_id后仍命中则返回SKU_SPEC_ALREADY_EXISTS。</li><li id="doxcntlVk0V5clOZE5wwqG1M2yb" seq-marker="5. ">BEAD和ACCESSORY的spec_signature为空，继续以diameter_mm等本身字段表达材料规格。</li></ol><p id="doxcnoSjqo56itrzYBtPHpkcWqd"><b>下架分支</b></p><p id="doxcnkDutXqkYaDnIdZCJQXOQbh" text-indent="1">现有SKU从is_on_sale=1改为0时，Service进入下一节的下架事务；没有deactivation_impact_hash、存在库存预占或预览内容已变化时不保存。现有SKU保持下架、从下架重新上架或仅修改其他字段时不触发退分。</p><pre id="doxcnMA1WA50bL3hB47ijsgvcad" caption="保存响应&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "ok": true,<br/>  "code": "OK",<br/>  "message": "",<br/>  "data": {<br/>    "sku_id": "4001",<br/>    "item_id": "3001",<br/>    "spec_values": {"gravel_type": "STANDARD_WHITE"},<br/>    "spec_signature": "SHA-256十六进制摘要",<br/>    "diameter_mm": null,<br/>    "image_file_id": "cloud://sku/4001.png",<br/>    "price_cent": 12800,<br/>    "is_on_sale": true,<br/>    "points_exchange_enabled": true,<br/>    "points_cost": 100,<br/>    "updated_at": "2026-10-09T14:30:00+08:00"<br/>  },<br/>  "request_id": "cloudbase-request-id"<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcnUaSCWWn6NU5sniBhigWibh"><b>错误码：</b>字段错误返回INVALID_ARGUMENT；商品或SKU不存在返回NOT_FOUND；规格不属于spec_schema返回SPEC_SCHEMA_MISMATCH；相同商品已有相同规格返回SKU_SPEC_ALREADY_EXISTS；下架冲突使用下一节定义的错误码。</p><h4 id="doxcniVj09unrM06OQsHwfbUa9d" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.11.2.6">SKU 下架、删除与兑换券退分</h4><p id="doxcnxVn8UkC2laX0ZwsgLVvYTg" text-indent="1">库存预占决定能否下架，兑换券只决定没有预占时需要退回多少积分。普通现金订单和使用兑换券的订单使用同一库存规则。</p><p id="doxcnKtXaUytiJth16N3ZSnwmxf"><b>第一步：影响预览</b></p><pre id="doxcnx4G8PghvBahr80TVj2Jozc" caption="请求&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "previewSkuDeactivation",<br/>  "payload": {<br/>    "sku_id": "001",<br/>    "operation": "OFF_SALE"<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcn8F5Bq8yIeXkpDv3z47HkdV" text-indent="1">operation只允许OFF_SALE或DELETE。Service查询SKU当前状态、stock_reserved、RESERVED库存预占、AVAILABLE与LOCKED兑换券，并按账户聚合AVAILABLE券的points_cost_snapshot。</p><pre id="doxcnAIWrL5fhJmRnqsOcylo1Ud" caption="存在库存预占&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "ok": true,<br/>  "code": "OK",<br/>  "message": "",<br/>  "data": {<br/>    "sku_id": "001",<br/>    "operation": "OFF_SALE",<br/>    "stock_reserved": 3,<br/>    "pending_order_count": 2,<br/>    "can_execute": false,<br/>    "available_coupon_count": 3,<br/>    "refundable_points": 300,<br/>    "affected_accounts": [],<br/>    "impact_hash": null<br/>  },<br/>  "request_id": "cloudbase-request-id"<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcn5qHJJs4qtC9a8ukZPSgyrh" text-indent="1">stock_reserved大于0时，管理端弹窗展示待付款订单数量和预占数量，确认按钮保持禁用；不执行下架、删除或退分。订单支付成功后预占转为CONSUMED，未付款关单后转为RELEASED，两种结果都会减少stock_reserved，管理员随后重新预览。</p><pre id="doxcnIN0LnTOBR2SHtjWHNbNRnf" caption="允许执行并展示退分影响&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "ok": true,<br/>  "code": "OK",<br/>  "message": "",<br/>  "data": {<br/>    "sku_id": "001",<br/>    "operation": "DELETE",<br/>    "stock_reserved": 0,<br/>    "pending_order_count": 0,<br/>    "can_execute": true,<br/>    "available_coupon_count": 3,<br/>    "refundable_points": 300,<br/>    "affected_accounts": [<br/>      {<br/>        "account_id": "1001",<br/>        "openid_masked": "oAbc****9XyZ",<br/>        "coupon_count": 2,<br/>        "refund_points": 200<br/>      },<br/>      {<br/>        "account_id": "1002",<br/>        "openid_masked": "oDef****2Klm",<br/>        "coupon_count": 1,<br/>        "refund_points": 100<br/>      }<br/>    ],<br/>    "impact_hash": "SHA-256十六进制摘要"<br/>  },<br/>  "request_id": "cloudbase-request-id"<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcn1M9GBGudvZtVHdFkiYpE16" text-indent="1"><b>impact_hash计算：</b>Service按固定字段顺序构造规范JSON：sku_id、operation、stock_reserved，以及按coupon_id升序排列的refundable_coupons[{coupon_id,account_id,points_cost_snapshot}]，序列化后计算SHA-256十六进制摘要。openid_masked和页面展示合计不进入摘要。确认请求中重新生成同一摘要，用于发现预览后新增、使用或锁定的兑换券。</p><p id="doxcnHK2ndX9Bnc0x9fPggjGlGf"><b>第二步：确认下架或删除</b></p><p id="doxcnFjdQgP23pMgfOjDRF4KjGc" text-indent="1">下架通过saveCatalogSku提交is_on_sale=false及deactivation_impact_hash；删除通过deleteCatalogSku提交sku_id及impact_hash。</p><pre id="doxcn6LlGLFNBp4QcNeWxfgxsGf" caption="删除请求&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "deleteCatalogSku",<br/>  "payload": {<br/>    "sku_id": "001",<br/>    "impact_hash": "预览返回的impact_hash"<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><ol><li id="doxcnBGHfWFxfR00ESqK7v6retd" seq="1" seq-marker="1. ">事务内锁定catalog_skus并重新检查stock_reserved=0；大于0返回SKU_HAS_PENDING_ORDERS。</li><li id="doxcnxKngZsqPOuhM1mk17Swi9t" seq-marker="2. ">重新查询AVAILABLE兑换券并计算影响摘要；与impact_hash不一致返回SKU_DEACTIVATION_IMPACT_CHANGED，管理端重新展示预览。</li><li id="doxcnd0QXvf1RfiXXdN72kXlnvf" seq-marker="3. ">如果出现LOCKED兑换券但stock_reserved=0，返回SKU_COUPON_STATE_CONFLICT并停止；该状态表示库存与兑换券数据不一致。</li><li id="doxcnZBizqzc4DZV4eIG6yRBCUf" seq-marker="4. ">按account_id升序锁定受影响的points_accounts，再按coupon_id锁定AVAILABLE兑换券。</li><li id="doxcnAqFXSmYUAoSt6PtlAlIHGd" seq-marker="5. ">每张券按points_cost_snapshot增加账户balance；total_earned和total_spent不变；写points_ledger，source_type=POINTS_EXCHANGE_REFUND、event_key='POINTS_EXCHANGE_REFUND:'+coupon_id、source_ref=coupon_id。</li><li id="doxcnZIXgoIaDu0wCEyRSncdgV3" seq-marker="6. ">兑换券改为REFUNDED，写refunded_at和refund_reason；下架写is_on_sale=0，删除写is_deleted=1。</li><li id="doxcn34Z6xoe7iy2tDauGnFbNXd" seq-marker="7. ">积分账户、积分流水、兑换券和SKU状态在同一个UnitOfWork中提交；event_key保证重试不重复退分。</li></ol><pre id="doxcnt1zzdZCHsa3OJ4X1XxIDtf" caption="执行响应&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "ok": true,<br/>  "code": "OK",<br/>  "message": "",<br/>  "data": {<br/>    "sku_id": "001",<br/>    "operation": "DELETE",<br/>    "is_on_sale": false,<br/>    "is_deleted": true,<br/>    "refunded_coupon_count": 3,<br/>    "refunded_points": 300,<br/>    "affected_account_count": 2,<br/>    "idempotent_replay": false<br/>  },<br/>  "request_id": "cloudbase-request-id"<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcnBxwr1wRL9Au8hphPVXiG4e"><b>父商品和分类：</b>下架、停用或删除以前检查全部子SKU；任一子SKU的stock_reserved大于0则整个操作返回SKU_HAS_PENDING_ORDERS。商品或分类删除不自动跳过退分流程；管理端先逐个完成子SKU的下架或删除，再删除父记录。</p><p id="doxcnYlfwX5tcgwTyiuQR4bDqwd"><b>错误码：</b>存在预占返回SKU_HAS_PENDING_ORDERS；影响变化返回SKU_DEACTIVATION_IMPACT_CHANGED；兑换券与库存状态不一致返回SKU_COUPON_STATE_CONFLICT；目标不存在返回NOT_FOUND；管理员无权限返回UNAUTHORIZED或FORBIDDEN。</p><h4 id="doxcnMtOWPKk7YSx6gkBUf0CJDe" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.11.2.7">updateSiteConfig</h4><pre id="doxcnFZdBTDqY0ZqAoMe7LcCO1b" caption="&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "updateSiteConfig",<br/>  "payload": {<br/>    "config_key": "feature_entries",<br/>    "config_value": [<br/>      {"key": "DIY", "enabled": true}<br/>    ]<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcnhtaJdem8FYsNSHR9hMVtzh"><b>后端逻辑：</b>config_key 只能是 home_banners、customer_service、feature_entries、shipping_rules、payment_rules、points_rules 等代码白名单；Service 按 key 校验 config_value 固定结构。写入 config_value、updated_by=当前 UID、updated_at。支付凭据和商户私钥禁止存入 site_config。</p><p id="doxcnhaG38ZIfpv9YT8Il6d3wmf"><b>shipping_rules 固定结构</b></p><pre id="doxcnXYa09pksJ0fOpH1etLwOVx" caption="&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "regions": [<br/>    {<br/>      "province_code": "440000",<br/>      "province_name": "广东省",<br/>      "shipping_fee_cent": 800,<br/>      "sort_order": 10,<br/>      "enabled": true<br/>    }<br/>  ]<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcnzJLDaidmANWdrVxNqnx5pe" text-indent="1">省份代码不得重复；运费为非负整数分。地址页只展示 enabled=true 的省份，PricingService 按订单地址的 province_code 读取 shipping_fee_cent。</p><p id="doxcn4nFTEM3kvRRQL7B3n9gAOc"><b>payment_rules 固定结构</b></p><pre id="doxcnkcHsqcI7ND0WTSy8QcyTef" caption="&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "payment_timeout_minutes": 5<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcnQWQfV9Qug4xvVkDAIS0Npc" text-indent="1">本期固定配置为 5 分钟。CheckoutService 创建订单时以数据库当前时间加该时长生成 payment_deadline_at；PaymentService 将同一时间作为微信支付 time_expire。</p><p id="doxcn9nq6jju6yuv2nldjuk04eh"><b>数据库写入</b></p><table id="doxcny6nc9rp5ZaKF8ALwVwbPpe"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnl1Gw8I2cfy6MKyqI0DNOud">action</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnjHOtArEFUAPDVNlQjPJCld">数据表</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnkCJiNvjkanv5WGPJMFKyWH">主要字段</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnteCVFTWamuZGPSOYJR2VfY">saveCategory</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnB3Ggv3TLXoY11J9Yb3WbB2">catalog_categories</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnOPe5YbZmiryAPJp1yzTKKe">catalog_type、name、sort_order、is_enabled。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnMSuhbIj1SqLv5h1aGmZsqf">saveCatalogItem</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnSgiy86HAlvlqwqn7iZwnLg">catalog_items</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnsHyvrd6d1SvGC1oUywLVjc">category_id、资料、images、spec_schema、is_on_sale。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnHpnQgX9nyemIf7CsUquBBh">saveCatalogSku</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnOZ86gpw37JQob6CFL2QbPf">catalog_skus</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnGcdL956Abcp0Qz2UYHSGJb">item_id、spec_values、珠径、图片、price_cent、points_exchange_enabled、points_cost、is_on_sale。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnaz7lU2ddpi7BzkiMBZsJeh">updateSiteConfig</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnX8lKPs8ZAqzYp0GkSsHIAb">site_config</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnyolpOWajK1KNhG8Gxmdz7e">config_value、updated_by、updated_at。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxcnJxyMVgKAIyMQGxAZHCuTV5"><b>错误码</b></p><table id="doxcnywXdkIDQLeSlgFs8igUE7b"><colgroup><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnpxEixGYfzX5nI8ve2Z7HOg">code</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnOv3ZBYmaVpD9nHWmbziFTb">触发条件</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnbv6HkhOeodZdh6M1LiPOdg">INVALID_ARGUMENT</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnESVIwmJsOpKjmRqwGPPhyd">字段、价格、规格结构或配置结构错误。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnW8pboZXz9jhCJStgPRBOfO">NOT_FOUND</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnJ4GC9Fs0b9WOoRcakV6KEg">分类、商品或 SKU 不存在、已删除。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnR01e1ywRYty9jsBSuvS66g">CATALOG_TYPE_CONFLICT</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnI9DYlImjwIlwImp67dq5Kh">有商品的分类修改类型，或商品移动到不同类型分类。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnaaZXE3psDbPNejfqzN1DVh">SPEC_SCHEMA_MISMATCH</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnqVF2pX9CxIVCMdZe4OjSYg">spec_values 不属于商品 spec_schema。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnR7mGw3DGRrHiRvOTpsM6kh">FORBIDDEN</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn399TNeTQO2ep1VXbpO1ekb">没有有效管理员权限。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxcnYTtg2xtaHIc3jx7T9Mjb5d" text-indent="1">下架更新 is_on_sale，业务删除更新 is_deleted；历史设计保存时副本、订单成交快照和仍被引用的云存储文件不随目录修改而清除。</p><p id="doxcn4Dtjfrzbc85PrMPZPYDmAb">云存储能力依据：<a href="https://docs.cloudbase.net/storage/introduce">CloudBase 云存储</a>。</p><h3 id="doxcnR396j9kBlbnCwDZfjNsw0e" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.11.3">库存调整</h3><whiteboard id="doxcnhVrCDRqcy2YzHlX0hUIMdf" token="T2VMwZ9W5hTkBVb0wXQc5uSMnUW" type="mermaid">sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as 商家 Web 管理端
    participant B as 业务普通云函数
    participant D as CloudBase MySQL
    A-&gt;&gt;B: SKU、调整数量、原因、操作标识
    B-&gt;&gt;B: 校验管理员与参数
    B-&gt;&gt;D: 开启事务，锁 catalog_skus
    B-&gt;&gt;D: 检查 event_key 是否已处理
    alt 首次操作且新总量不低于预占
      B-&gt;&gt;D: 更新 stock_total
      B-&gt;&gt;D: 插入 ADMIN_ADJUST 流水及 operator_uid
      B-&gt;&gt;D: 提交事务
      B--&gt;&gt;A: 调整后总量、预占和可用量
    else 重复或非法调整
      B--&gt;&gt;A: 返回原结果或拒绝，不再变库存
    end
    A-&gt;&gt;B: 查看该 SKU 库存流水
    B-&gt;&gt;D: inventory_movements 按 SKU 和时间分页
    B--&gt;&gt;A: 变动数量、订单来源、管理员与原因</whiteboard><h4 id="doxcniM7h7jvVOLntDbODcWdW4c" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.11.3.1">接口清单</h4><table id="doxcnlTjUSr0FORxag0OErxJjEb"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnshAgNQMN90FrHrHVNzDRDf">云函数与 action</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnq4DXtVegQ2sZBoTved9pDc">身份</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnsM185uCqGDU4QMHctIaUxj">用途</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnN8h6cN0ibB4DAC26So62Db">business-api / adjustInventory</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnSoKq6pjRmQq5qykiYNba4d">认证 UID + 白名单</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnKmCsE1JUNZjwmtI8kCJOpd">以增减量调整 SKU 总库存，并写管理员库存流水。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcngFm178ITC8ciR3k5L7dCYb">business-api / listInventoryMovements</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnFjQPiaenE1KU12lbCMSmIe">认证 UID + 白名单</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnthP1Kh8iwykzByVADzvOof">按 SKU 和时间分页查看库存变动原因。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxcnR9oBobk8w0jxgA59Zo3FZ5"><b>代码映射</b></p><table id="doxcnH8DLVEgtd65SmRpmGb8dSg"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnO2XbvUCdml1xGkJTz68dNf">action / 路由</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnGoqHHMkqxHS8TDeZm7kHtd">Handler / Controller</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnS0qI6OMV9sAyp6rMwAR9Ig">Service</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnbgMNKqouXPRW6Bq6b5BSbg">UnitOfWork</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnmGHod3Zs5aLfo3MAV11zAg">DAO / Client</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnPWLR7XnJdZTWIVOKzU0DQf">adjustInventory</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnfruOW1pQ8ly9pQj4lsj2Ff">AdjustInventoryHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnA7K8Md6C4F1Md37vxSmyBh">InventoryService</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcny1JsQK1XLrO6DI2xrdtVEd">是</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnQEFmdqxqdYAG4Ih5lxhCoh">AdminDAO、SkuDAO、InventoryMovementDAO</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnJ1SZ7vtG7TW0hiRwVffjZg">listInventoryMovements</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn7T0frMgLeBLi6Fe5xgSq3f">ListInventoryMovementsHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn4u8DLORQv4fNZpCFpRheVB">InventoryService</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnMawb447EkBLO2xEHPCdzjc">否</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnutVQhw5oSSxobRSPQvHWO7">AdminDAO、InventoryMovementDAO</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h4 id="doxcnciojnr1cvWlwbpgTopRj2c" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.11.3.2">adjustInventory</h4><p id="doxcnlpFu4KCqFlPmL5CqU2oBzb"><b>请求 JSON</b></p><pre id="doxcn2ZQMIw8noxsa3rUbQ2WK6e" caption="&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "adjustInventory",<br/>  "payload": {<br/>    "operation_key": "admin-adjust-20261007-0001",<br/>    "sku_id": "4001",<br/>    "stock_delta": 5,<br/>    "remark": "盘点补录"<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><table id="doxcnO1Yd7EXlQAJDk5dOJ7xfHe"><colgroup><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnCwvCBqjqeVt2ZzZK4iQYug">字段</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcneAGVPjSsidWRuoW4T6ltPf">含义</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn2DZE8u77xRA3KlZVXaVnyb">operation_key</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnRkqO7o1qHWC5WEAxNaIgTh">管理端在发送前生成并持久化的操作幂等键；同一次超时重试必须复用。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn00nQoyevfNFcBbkZ3vOzX6">sku_id</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn2Gdji1dnsFjYgXXhe9g5qf">需要调整的 SKU。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnH9kbeJ6DZZ5qD32EDJac6e">stock_delta</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcncwBTUH4HNFRwqclG3dXmzf">总库存增减量；增加为正、减少为负，不能为 0。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnABUKBCPlV7ZAEzHDti6Owe">remark</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn5Vzr7O3AXZorZt2QJuOXoc">盘点或调整原因，必填。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxcnLbNZhmWTQOxoVO2ML5EPSd"><b>响应 JSON</b></p><pre id="doxcnVjPNYF68VSU5tUvNUNInnd" caption="&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "ok": true,<br/>  "code": "OK",<br/>  "data": {<br/>    "sku_id": "4001",<br/>    "stock_total": 15,<br/>    "stock_reserved": 3,<br/>    "available_stock": 12<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcndnNQzc4glIVIG4dB6e7uqc"><b>后端处理步骤</b></p><ol><li id="doxcn0hHuyk2HgDAB4D4rXdRGnc" seq="1" seq-marker="1. ">校验管理员权限、operation_key、stock_delta 和 remark。</li><li id="doxcnHp2D0ZhdpQrLwANtxs86ph" seq-marker="2. ">生成 inventory_movements.event_key='ADMIN_ADJUST:'+operation_key+':'+sku_id，并先查询是否已存在；存在时返回原调整后的当前库存。</li><li id="doxcnyfoELAsmZOg0tTRA03zpbc" seq-marker="3. ">开启事务并按 sku_id 锁定 catalog_skus。</li><li id="doxcntV7n7E4Wvi413Ay0xpkHvd" seq-marker="4. ">计算 new_stock_total=stock_total+stock_delta；若小于 stock_reserved 或小于 0，拒绝调整。</li><li id="doxcnEoZpjLXuXDZUCz8QZx3Moc" seq-marker="5. ">更新 catalog_skus.stock_total；插入 ADMIN_ADJUST 流水，stock_delta=请求值、reserved_delta=0、operator_uid=当前 UID。</li><li id="doxcnKvMKNfqiJzaXa76tGJJc9c" seq-marker="6. ">提交事务并返回总量、预占量和可用量。</li></ol><h4 id="doxcneJJaJPYNOewl5kZP1qzoZW" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.11.3.3">listInventoryMovements</h4><pre id="doxcnTBFSryYST3yDmDfP9u8k6f" caption="请求&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "listInventoryMovements",<br/>  "payload": {<br/>    "sku_id": "4001",<br/>    "page_token": null,<br/>    "page_size": 20<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><pre id="doxcniClvKpjYr4VEfhfu0JcbLe" caption="响应&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "ok": true,<br/>  "code": "OK",<br/>  "data": {<br/>    "movements": [<br/>      {<br/>        "action": "ADMIN_ADJUST",<br/>        "stock_delta": 5,<br/>        "reserved_delta": 0,<br/>        "order_id": null,<br/>        "operator_uid": "管理员UID",<br/>        "remark": "盘点补录",<br/>        "created_at": "2026-10-07T18:30:00+08:00"<br/>      }<br/>    ],<br/>    "next_page_token": null<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcn9NrHMn34nJOwhYQrmikyWd"><b>查询条件：</b>inventory_movements.sku_id=请求值、is_deleted=0，按 created_at DESC、id DESC 分页。流水用于审计，不作为每次读取库存时重新计算余额的数据源。</p><p id="doxcntPjXOlyh1Ekznb8dAjQF6d"><b>错误码</b></p><h3 id="doxcndp8IwK7JWr6ZSWAWDuCPsc" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.11.4">积分与兑换配置</h3><p id="doxcnZ0pQce2c5yR9bJHWs2UIOd" text-indent="1">商家 Web 管理端在 SKU 编辑表单中配置是否允许积分兑换和所需积分；在固定结构配置页维护签到与首单完成奖励。P0 只提供固定规则和只读审计查询，不设计通用积分规则引擎。</p><h4 id="doxcnqqV07RAdOIC2SSbJJmqNIc" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.11.4.1">SKU 积分兑换字段</h4><p id="doxcnhEqAw1gDtceM6a9dolxzIh" text-indent="1">points_exchange_enabled和points_cost属于5.11.2.5所定义的saveCatalogSku全量保存请求，必须与SKU其他可编辑字段一并提交。只有catalog_type=BEAD的SKU允许开启积分兑换；开启时points_cost必须是大于0的整数，关闭时points_cost写NULL。</p><p id="doxcnlNWP7dvu8qBeIhkPTqCzWU" text-indent="1">已有兑换券只保存sku_id和points_cost_snapshot，不随当前points_cost修改。SKU下架或删除按5.11.2.6执行：有库存预占时拒绝操作；没有预占时按每张AVAILABLE券的points_cost_snapshot退分并改为REFUNDED。</p><h4 id="doxcnaFqJXlNYnF9jLNMxsA7vAh" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.11.4.2">积分规则配置</h4><pre id="doxcnO3NFENq7UhvAb22AoYjMjc" caption="updateSiteConfig 请求&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "updateSiteConfig",<br/>  "payload": {<br/>    "config_key": "points_rules",<br/>    "config_value": {<br/>      "daily_check_in_points": 5,<br/>      "referral_first_completed_order_points": 100<br/>    }<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcnrL8snXYQ4EaHNCK0WAJZug"><b>校验：</b>两个值都必须是非负整数；业务 Service 只读取代码白名单中的固定字段。配置变更只影响之后发生的积分事件，不回算历史流水。</p><h4 id="doxcnnhUQK54f2VIv8EnenZREhg" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.11.4.3">审计查询</h4><table id="doxcn7FzCFMW7JU909zLwqD9tAd"><colgroup><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcngYOaRgCACIXYIy15FEnpSh">action</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnW52AXI03PtzEZaXvghnJBg">用途与主要入参</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnHEDDQ3bWlT8vOkfndCmtPh">listAdminPointsLedger</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnGDOrkeqeLn6k2453L7cIlb">按 OpenID、source_type 和时间分页查询 points_ledger；不允许修改流水。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcngIaS9tNVMJilH1gWoen41Q">listAdminReferralRelations</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcndgCoFP7KA0mxhPrfZOq8Og">按分享人、被分享人和是否已奖励查询 referral_relations。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnm0SdjkZEfzxQrgYsPKKCig">listAdminSkuCoupons</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnoxXCD5P8AUc0keMc1FpV0e">按 sku_id、OpenID、status 和时间查询 user_sku_coupons，并显示 locked_order_no 或 used_order_no。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><pre id="doxcnwltOCAj61MR6YYXH6iHrRd" caption="管理端分页请求通用示例&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "listAdminSkuCoupons",<br/>  "payload": {<br/>    "sku_id": "001",<br/>    "status": "AVAILABLE",<br/>    "page_token": null,<br/>    "page_size": 20<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcnUnCKgzewAwjEPCWgOgOA8f"><b>响应约定：</b>返回符合条件的记录、当前 SKU 展示资料和 next_page_token；所有管理接口先通过 CloudBase 认证会话与 admin_allowlist 检查。</p><table id="doxcnpn9flddZBLc3oJeH0xQtwg"><colgroup><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnoYTnK4NtQ8XIz9YJHPcHdb">code</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnOzY2pcuyrDSB4pE4jVbric">触发条件</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn1Klc3uTybJwr7q1PkT9hJf">INVALID_ARGUMENT</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnfCsaBNpiP55cbyPIKha8Xd">调整量为 0、原因为空或操作键格式错误。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnNE2gK4SJVlNr1VHIqhXzRd">NOT_FOUND</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn1iroJe6FoIS0jsFJstJWid">SKU 不存在或已删除。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnnlfhK9BqFajplNXBFZLTqg">INVENTORY_CONSTRAINT</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnaEFjrxTDQCK36qMJp13CPb">调整后总量小于已预占量或小于 0。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnHh6A0KBSntWK4hpEsi2Vnb">FORBIDDEN</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnHqTBXpUZa5RRuERU336aWh">没有有效管理员权限。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="doxcn91g2jmNTzEaKUEmsRCDxlb" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.11.5">支付对账异常</h3><p id="doxcnKPJHAr29vuRAMPlBmvmfyd" text-indent="1">管理端首页展示 resolution_status=OPEN 的对账异常数量，点击进入列表和详情。管理员只能补充处理结果，不直接通过本模块修改订单金额或支付状态。</p><table id="doxcnFIkM62wMy8E0v2CfZn3Rvf"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnqu5nDjGc56pzv9fXxOKHrf">action</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcno1eTiNp615iHNp0tOQvKIh">Handler</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn3ccdpeBAHBBinclFC63Ehb">Service 方法</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnCpp6nipcZ92eqLvcbMbJCF">listPaymentReconciliationIssues</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn3TcjuPBbsGUWO8u5WlrLJg">ListPaymentReconciliationIssuesHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcncvqP1DOkRYBl0x9mCccvkh">PaymentReconciliationService.listIssues()</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnfyTgLcjafLnLe05zwlpPmc">getPaymentReconciliationIssue</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnbA32pTjUvqb5GJqarB9Z8c">GetPaymentReconciliationIssueHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnIx2ejaICLzl5obml3yW0qf">PaymentReconciliationService.getIssue()</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnmbsVLB2FpxMwi6XlV9cRef">resolvePaymentReconciliationIssue</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnynSBLWrdLbZRNuskulBrJc">ResolvePaymentReconciliationIssueHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnN7FtZB1JTupGWH19U3U9ec">PaymentReconciliationService.resolveIssue()</p></td></tr></tbody></table><pre id="doxcn3tH5xCDeUO5wmILimZUTqe" caption="列表请求&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "listPaymentReconciliationIssues",<br/>  "payload": {<br/>    "resolution_status": "OPEN",<br/>    "bill_date": null,<br/>    "issue_type": null,<br/>    "page_token": null,<br/>    "page_size": 20<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcnt40taEUAKxKsY1DCFKcAbg" text-indent="1"><b>列表响应：</b>返回 issue_id、bill_date、issue_type、order_no、out_trade_no、本地状态、微信状态、两侧金额、resolution_status、created_at 和 next_page_token。</p><pre id="doxcnKeiHiROBz9xN3qw6t1jYdb" caption="详情请求&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "getPaymentReconciliationIssue",<br/>  "payload": {"issue_id": "901"}<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcnXOYMdYb9wC5D5l48Gbae3J" text-indent="1"><b>详情响应：</b>返回该差异的完整字段、关联订单与支付记录摘要、处理说明和处理人；不存在或已删除返回 NOT_FOUND。</p><pre id="doxcn7BLHb6laJHaxh6Wstg5tUb" caption="处理请求&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "resolvePaymentReconciliationIssue",<br/>  "payload": {<br/>    "issue_id": "901",<br/>    "resolution_status": "RESOLVED",<br/>    "resolution_note": "已人工核对微信账单与本地支付记录"<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcn9GwFlKaPY0YHpPIcZrk0pc" text-indent="1">Service 校验可信管理员后更新 resolution_status、resolution_note、resolved_by、resolved_at、updated_at。状态只能从 OPEN 转为 RESOLVED 或 IGNORED；重复提交相同状态和备注按幂等成功返回。错误码为 UNAUTHORIZED、FORBIDDEN、NOT_FOUND、INVALID_ARGUMENT 和 ISSUE_ALREADY_RESOLVED。</p></fragment>
